1
00:00:00,389 --> 00:00:02,719
(Amy:)Forget it.
I don't expect you guys to understand.

2
00:00:02,891 --> 00:00:04,051
(Raj:)I understand.

3
00:00:04,226 --> 00:00:07,716
In seventh grade, I played spin-the-bottle
and it landed on Alina Shankar.

4
00:00:07,896 --> 00:00:12,166
(Raj:)She said if I came near her,
she would break the bottle and cut me.

5
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:13,667
(Amy:)You think that's bad?

6
00:00:13,869 --> 00:00:18,069
(Amy:)In college, I passed out at a frat party
and woke up with more clothes on.

7
00:00:22,945 --> 00:00:26,405
Sometimes I get so Ionely I sit
on my left hand until it goes numb...

8
00:00:26,581 --> 00:00:31,111
(Raj:)...then I put it in my right hand and pretend
I'm holding hands with another person.

9
00:00:31,954 --> 00:00:33,254
(Amy:)I do that too.

10
00:00:34,289 --> 00:00:37,489
(Amy:)Sometimes the left hand tries
to cop a feel.

11
00:00:38,327 --> 00:00:40,197
(Amy:)And I let it.

12
00:00:42,898 --> 00:00:46,998
(Raj:)It's kind of nice to talk to someone who
understands what it feels like to be alone.

13
00:00:47,169 --> 00:00:48,539
(Amy:)It is, isn't it?

14
00:00:48,704 --> 00:00:51,134
(Raj:)But you're not alone anymore.
Now you've got Sheldon.

15
00:00:51,306 --> 00:00:55,536
(Amy:)I do. And don't worry,
someday you'll have somebody too.

16
00:00:55,711 --> 00:01:02,021
(Raj:)Thank you. I hope she's half as lovely
and amazing as you are.

